            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "text": "The authors claim that a Bell-sampling run with classical memory estimates the even-moment vector with O(kn) classical runtime, and give concentration bounds for the normalized truncated and full partition functions. These supplementary statements qualify the discussion's broad uniform-cost additive-estimation claim. This is an unverified author-claim candidate."
      }
    ],
    "conditions": [
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:sampling-qualifications-0",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:d86960ecac9be6cefa6c3b51556e4dbaaea857f309b4d1800acc4a3113bf8ffb",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1603-1603",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:606ae10f868eb77d1b255bad943e6b287f8aabbfa1a9d4ab73b2f085ac2aee8a",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-2089-2188",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:59155318187f414289795af5457503389da2b5e5ea13f99284410e27f9f0af31",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-2192-2231",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "psi is a pure n-qubit state and d_n=2^n."
      },
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:sampling-qualifications-1",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:d86960ecac9be6cefa6c3b51556e4dbaaea857f309b4d1800acc4a3113bf8ffb",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1603-1603",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:606ae10f868eb77d1b255bad943e6b287f8aabbfa1a9d4ab73b2f085ac2aee8a",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-2089-2188",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:59155318187f414289795af5457503389da2b5e5ea13f99284410e27f9f0af31",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-2192-2231",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "The algorithm assumes preparation of both psi and its complex conjugate psi*, Bell sampling, and repeated measurement of psi in a sampled Pauli eigenbasis."
      },
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:sampling-qualifications-2",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:d86960ecac9be6cefa6c3b51556e4dbaaea857f309b4d1800acc4a3113bf8ffb",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1603-1603",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:606ae10f868eb77d1b255bad943e6b287f8aabbfa1a9d4ab73b2f085ac2aee8a",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-2089-2188",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:59155318187f414289795af5457503389da2b5e5ea13f99284410e27f9f0af31",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-2192-2231",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "The truncation includes even powers through 2k; the algorithm requires integer k>1."
      },
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:sampling-qualifications-3",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:d86960ecac9be6cefa6c3b51556e4dbaaea857f309b4d1800acc4a3113bf8ffb",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1603-1603",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:606ae10f868eb77d1b255bad943e6b287f8aabbfa1a9d4ab73b2f085ac2aee8a",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-2089-2188",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:59155318187f414289795af5457503389da2b5e5ea13f99284410e27f9f0af31",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-2192-2231",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "Samples are taken in N outer-loop runs and the full-function theorem requires epsilon>Delta(beta,k)."
      },
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:sampling-qualifications-4",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:d86960ecac9be6cefa6c3b51556e4dbaaea857f309b4d1800acc4a3113bf8ffb",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1603-1603",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:606ae10f868eb77d1b255bad943e6b287f8aabbfa1a9d4ab73b2f085ac2aee8a",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-2089-2188",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:59155318187f414289795af5457503389da2b5e5ea13f99284410e27f9f0af31",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-2192-2231",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "Efficiency in the supplementary prose is stated for fixed k and beta."
      }
